{"seq":3,"slug":"nosql-specialized","title":"NoSQL 与专用数据库","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"document-keyvalue-stores","title":"文档数据库与键值存储选型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/document-keyvalue-stores","wordCount":1484,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-column-timeseries","title":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/wide-column-timeseries","wordCount":1718,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-vector-databases","title":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/graph-vector-databases","wordCount":1808,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# NoSQL 与专用数据库\n\n并非所有工作负载都适合关系模型。当访问模式以键查找为主、当数据天然带时间戳、当关系本身就是查询对象时，专用数据库能提供关系型引擎无法企及的性能和建模表达力。本章按数据模型分类：文档与键值存储覆盖最广泛的 NoSQL 场景；宽列与时序数据库解决高基数写入问题；图数据库与向量数据库则面向 2026 年增长最快的两个方向——关系推理和语义检索。\n"}